# A Slim view's Ruby was missed where Slim 5 reads it, so gems it used
# were `unreferenced`, `clear`: a whitespace modifier after a tag
# (`span> =`), a splat (`.card*x`), a conditional comment's children
# (`/[if …]`), a namespaced tag (`svg:path d=x`), and spaces around an
# attribute's `=`. Text after an attribute is still text: IdleKit stays
# a row.
dead Gemfile modifier_kit=none splat_kit=none cond_kit=none ns_kit=none spaced_kit=none idle_kit=unreferenced~
